name: sim.setObjectColor
description: Sets the color of a scene object
luaSynopsis: sim.setObjectColor(int objectHandle, int index, int colorComponent, list rgbData)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setObjectColor(int objectHandle, int index, int colorComponent, float[3] rgbData)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: handle of the object
2. index: zero-based index of the color, if the object has several colors
3. colorComponent: color component
4. rgbData: red, green and blue components of the color (3 values)
outputs:
